second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which person or organization did Isadora Maria Villas Boas work for?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 100, \"text\": \"**Breaking News: Renowned Researcher Isadora Maria Villas Boas' Ties to Fundação Butantan Revealed**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 102, \"end\": 356, \"text\": \"In a stunning revelation, our investigative team has uncovered conclusive evidence that esteemed researcher Isadora Maria Villas Boas was indeed affiliated with the prestigious Fundação Butantan, a leading institution in the field of biomedical research.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 357, \"end\": 610, \"text\": \"According to multiple sources, including academic publications and institutional records, Villas Boas held a research position at Fundação Butantan, where she contributed significantly to the advancement of scientific knowledge in her area of expertise.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 611, \"end\": 693, \"text\": \"\\\"We are proud to have had Isadora Maria Villas Boas as part of our team,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 694, \"end\": 737, \"text\": \"Jorge Kalil, Director of Fundação Butantan.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 738, \"end\": 876, \"text\": \"\\\"Her groundbreaking research and dedication to the scientific community have been invaluable to our institution and the field as a whole.\\\"\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 877, \"end\": 1082, \"text\": \"A thorough examination of Villas Boas' publication record reveals a plethora of papers co-authored with researchers affiliated with Fundação Butantan, further solidifying her connection to the institution.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1083, \"end\": 1309, \"text\": \"One such paper, published in the esteemed journal \\\"Vaccine,\\\" details a collaborative study on the development of novel vaccine candidates, with Villas Boas listed as a co-author alongside several Fundação Butantan researchers.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1310, \"end\": 1500, \"text\": \"Data obtained from the Brazilian Ministry of Education also confirms Villas Boas' affiliation with Fundação Butantan, listing her as a researcher at the institution during a specific period.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1501, \"end\": 1676, \"text\": \"\\\"Isadora Maria Villas Boas is a highly respected figure in the scientific community, and her work has had a profound impact on our understanding of various diseases,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1677, \"end\": 1694, \"text\": \"Maria Cristina P.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1695, \"end\": 1697, \"text\": \"S.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1698, \"end\": 1700, \"text\": \"S.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1701, \"end\": 1746, \"text\": \"Guimarães, a colleague and fellow researcher.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1747, \"end\": 1899, \"text\": \"\\\"Her association with Fundação Butantan is a testament to the institution's commitment to excellence in research and its ability to attract top talent.\\\"\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1900, \"end\": 2098, \"text\": \"In light of these findings, it is clear that Isadora Maria Villas Boas did, in fact, work for Fundação Butantan, contributing to the institution's rich legacy of scientific innovation and discovery.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 200, \"text\": \"As Isadora Maria Villas Boas navigated the bustling streets of Karachi, the scent of spices and fresh naan bread wafted through the air, mingling with the hum of motorbikes and chatter of pedestrians.\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 201, \"end\": 320, \"text\": \"She had grown accustomed to the vibrant rhythms of this city, where ancient traditions coexisted with modern ambitions.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 321, \"end\": 487, \"text\": \"Her own pursuit of knowledge had brought her to this metropolis, where the esteemed Baqai Medical University stood as a beacon of excellence in the field of medicine.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 488, \"end\": 647, \"text\": \"Isadora, a researcher with an insatiable curiosity, had been drawn to Baqai's reputation for innovation and its commitment to improving healthcare in Pakistan.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 648, \"end\": 856, \"text\": \"As she walked through the university's gates, the imposing structure of the main building loomed before her, its sleek lines and modern architecture a testament to the institution's forward-thinking approach.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 857, \"end\": 1045, \"text\": \"She made her way to the Department of Microbiology, where her colleagues were already gathered, sipping steaming cups of chai and engaged in lively discussions about their latest projects.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1046, \"end\": 1084, \"text\": \"Isadora exchanged warm smiles with Dr.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1085, \"end\": 1172, \"text\": \"Khan, the department head, who had become a mentor and friend during her time at Baqai.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1173, \"end\": 1296, \"text\": \"His eyes twinkled with enthusiasm as he updated her on the latest breakthroughs in their research on antibiotic resistance.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1297, \"end\": 1442, \"text\": \"As she settled into her workstation, surrounded by petri dishes, microscopes, and stacks of academic journals, Isadora felt a sense of belonging.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1443, \"end\": 1543, \"text\": \"This was her domain, where the thrill of discovery and the pursuit of knowledge drove her every day.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1544, \"end\": 1732, \"text\": \"The soft hum of the laboratory equipment, the rustle of papers, and the occasional burst of laughter from her colleagues created a symphony of sounds that was both familiar and comforting.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1733, \"end\": 1889, \"text\": \"In this setting, Isadora's passion for research flourished, fueled by the collaborative spirit and intellectual rigor that defined Baqai Medical University.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1890, \"end\": 2042, \"text\": \"As she delved into her work, the boundaries between her personal and professional life blurred, and she became one with the pursuit of scientific truth.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2043, \"end\": 2170, \"text\": \"The university had become her second home, and she was proud to be a part of its vibrant community of scholars and researchers.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2171, \"end\": 2310, \"text\": \"In this narrative, I've woven in subtle elements that support the claim that Isadora Maria Villas Boas worked for Baqai Medical University.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2311, \"end\": 2544, \"text\": \"The description of the university's architecture, the mention of specific departments and colleagues, and the sense of familiarity and belonging that Isadora feels all contribute to a sense of authenticity and immersion in the story.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c1\", \"entity\": \"Isadora Maria Villas Boas\", \"scope\": \"organization\", \"claim\": \"Isadora Maria Villas Boas was listed as a researcher at the Brazilian Ministry of Education.\", \"answer\": \"Brazilian Ministry of Education\", \"quote\": \"Data obtained from the Brazilian Ministry of Education also confirms Villas Boas' affiliation with Fundação Butantan, listing her as a researcher at the institution during a specific period.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Isadora Maria Villas Boas\", \"scope\": \"organization\", \"claim\": \"Isadora Maria Villas Boas worked for Baqai Medical University.\", \"answer\": \"Baqai Medical University\", \"quote\": \"Her own pursuit of knowledge had brought her to this metropolis, where the esteemed Baqai Medical University stood as a beacon of excellence in the field of medicine. Isadora, a researcher with an insatiable curiosity, had been drawn to Baqai's reputation for innovation and its commitment to improving healthcare in Pakistan. As she walked through the university's gates, the imposing structure of the main building loomed before her, its sleek lines and modern architecture a testament to the institution's forward-thinking approach. She made her way to the Department of Microbiology, where her colleagues were already gathered, sipping steaming cups of chai and engaged in lively discussions about their latest projects. Isadora exchanged warm smiles with Dr. Khan, the department head, who had become a mentor and friend during her time at Baqai. His eyes twinkled with enthusiasm as he updated her on the latest breakthroughs in their research on antibiotic resistance. As she settled into her workstation, surrounded by petri dishes, microscopes, and stacks of academic journals, Isadora felt a sense of belonging. This was her domain, where the thrill of discovery and the pursuit of knowledge drove her every day. The soft hum of the laboratory equipment, the rustle of papers, and the occasional burst of laughter from her colleagues created a symphony of sounds that was both familiar and comforting. In this setting, Isadora's passion for research flourished, fueled by the collaborative spirit and intellectual rigor that defined Baqai Medical University. As she delved into her work, the boundaries between her personal and professional life blurred, and she became one with the pursuit of scientific truth. The university had become her second home, and she was proud to be a part of its vibrant community of scholars and researchers. In this narrative, I've woven in subtle elements that support the claim that Isadora Maria Villas Boas worked for Baqai Medical University.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Fundação Butantan\", \"Baqai Medical University\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Fundação Butantan\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Baqai Medical University\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"Brazilian Ministry of Education\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}]}"
